#
# uPortal 6.0 schema facts the database metadata cannot tell (rule syntax: RuleSet). Until the
# 6.0 schema step (Hibernate 7) the tables are the 5.17 ones; the stored values differ (see
# from-5.17.rules). The generator catalog next to it (generators.tsv) is generated from the
# entity annotations.
#
# PostgreSQL large objects, as in 5.17 (MOD-I24).
lob-oid UP_RAW_EVENTS.EVENT_DATA
lob-oid UP_ANALYTICS_EVENTS.EVENT_DATA
